's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"417dc8a21f2ccf02919a1b47ed12f342","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"131e24f8a577109225b21daecbd34bb5","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"9563d30441c363247e729d7d064ecf86","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"7a61409acca11e3bff114fb04d50a51e","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"000a7a343f4d44386a8f81c123ca2832","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"f9027a826d872618374d701805aa02ef","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"cc40fed33d88634df0f92dde2b8367de","originalFileName":"8c89c1ec-3ec3-48c1-9166-ac282bb62437-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"8c3d91a666d4459d8f0dcb7893bb7a67","